  "prefLabel": "He-C 6423.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "2018-01-13",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 6423.01 Purpose. When children must be temporarily placed away from their families, the department of health and human services (DHHS) provides board, care, and clothing payments to the providers of foster family homes as they work with the child and his or her family. These rules publish the rates for reimbursing foster family homes.\n\nSource. #4447, eff 7-1-88, EXPIRED: 7-1-94\n\nNew. #9514, eff 7-18-09; ss by #12229, INTERIM, eff 7-17-17, EXPIRED: 1-13-18\n\nNew. #12470, eff 1-30-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-c6400.html"
